					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-113192#post-4082583</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-113192/scp-599#post-4082583</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 11 Dec 2018 04:44:55 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>stormbreath</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3075960</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>A lot of people have said that the final note being delivered by an O5 is slightly over the top, and I agree. That being said, I object to any thought about changing it. The line is greatly improved by value by the O5.</p> <p>Imagine this: you perform a difficult and somewhat dangerous assignment. You get back and request a pay increase, as you are wont to do. You wait to hear back, and then you receive a single line rejection from the shadowy, nebulous head of your entire organization, an organization which effectively controls the entire world, who has taken time out of their day to personally call you a bitch.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
