					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I don't like lolFoundation much, but&#8230;</p> <p>That bit at the end doesn't strike me as that. It's a little humorous no doubt, but it exactly like something your commanding officer or such would tell you in any line of work that involves extreme risks to personal health. If anything, I think the O5 was trying to sort of 'ease him in' after his (for a first timer) harrowing adventure. The Foundation is cold, but it is not incapable of feeling. It's just hard for it to do so.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
